[D Library books tier 10 (Friend of the Library) and the Cozy Sleeping Bag chain in one running loop from the Undercity Magic Quarter, about 4 hours instead of about 5 for the two guides on their own. The sleeping bag gives up to 3% bonus experience. Needs level 18 for the books; the road runs through level 25-40 zones and Alliance guards, so level 20-25 is the sensible start. Flight points and the hearthstone are optional. \\ The sleeping bag objects only work in order: Barrens, Westfall, Stonetalon, Loch Modan, Thoradin's Wall. \\ https://github.com/JanRK/Guidelime_DungeonQuests]
[GA Horde]
[N 20 Library Books Horde Tier 10 Cozy Sleeping Bag]

[OC]Optional: get the [P Undercity] flight path [G63.1,48.3 Undercity] (hub: flies to every Horde point in the Eastern Kingdoms)
[O]Leave Undercity and run to the zeppelin towers [G61.8,65 Tirisfal Glades][G61.2,58.9 Tirisfal Glades]
[O]Take the zeppelin to Orgrimmar [G51,13.9 Durotar]
[OC]Optional: get the [P Orgrimmar] flight path [G45.3,63.7 Orgrimmar] (hub: flies to every Horde point in Kalimdor)
[O]Run into Orgrimmar [G45.5,12 Durotar]
Loot *The Lessons of Ta'zo* [CI 207972 The Lessons of Ta'zo] in the Cleft of Shadow [G38.7,78.4 Orgrimmar]

[O]Leave Orgrimmar and follow the road to the Southfury bridge [G45.5,12 Durotar][G41,25 Durotar][G34.5,42.5 Durotar] \\ An elite Infernal may stand by the road west of Orgrimmar: give it room.
[OC]Optional: get the [P Crossroads] flight path [G51.5,30.4 The Barrens]
[O]Follow the Barrens road west and south past the Crossroads and Camp Taurajo [G61.8,20 The Barrens][G51,20 The Barrens][G52,30 The Barrens][G59,34 The Barrens][G55.5,38.6 The Barrens][G52,43.8 The Barrens][G50.4,49.8 The Barrens][G46.3,57.5 The Barrens][G45.5,66 The Barrens]
Search the Burned-Out Remains at the burnt tower and accept [QA79007 ... and that note you found] [G46.4,73.9 The Barrens] \\ The Westfall remains do nothing until you have this note.
[OC]Optional: get the [P Ratchet] flight path [G63.1,37.1 The Barrens] (neutral)
[O]Run back north to Baxtan's book [G45.5,66 The Barrens][G46.3,57.5 The Barrens][G50.4,49.8 The Barrens][G52,43.8 The Barrens][G55.5,38.6 The Barrens][G59,34 The Barrens]
Loot *Baxtan: On Destructive Magics* [CI 208800 Baxtan: On Destructive Magics] [G62.7,36.3 The Barrens] \\ Bruuz (elite, 20) patrols near the book.
