Loot *Nar'thalas Almanac, Vol. 74* [CI 209843 Nar'thalas Almanac, Vol. 74] [G59.6,22.2 Darkshore] \\ Stay east of Auberdine and its Alliance guards. Baron Marinous and Lady Vespira walk the coast nearby: keep your distance.
